# Local environment. NOTE: .env itself stays TRACKED — Lovable's build reads
# it, and it holds only publishable (browser-visible) Supabase values, which
# ship in the client bundle anyway. Real secrets — SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY,
# QUIZ_ANSWER_SALT — live in the platform environment and are never committed.
#
# The repository is public, so the margin for error here is zero: anything
# added to .env is published the moment it is pushed. Add new variables to
# .env.example (placeholders only) and set the real values in the platform.
# Untracking .env entirely is the safer end state, but only after confirming
# Lovable has the six VITE_/SUPABASE_ values in its own environment — remove
# it before that and the build loses its Supabase config.
.env.local
.env.*.local
